Package: sbyadanear
Type: Package
Title: Binary Resampling with ADASYN and NearMiss
Version: 0.4.0
Authors@R:
    person(given = "João Batista", family = "Gonçalves de Brito", role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4645-5217", email = "joao@sabby.com.br")
Description: Binary resampling with ADASYN and NearMiss 1, 2 and 3,
    exact neighbors and preservation of original records. Uses Intel oneAPI
    OpenMP and oneMKL on Linux, with scale, synthetic-lineage and thread audits.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/JoaoSabby/sbyadanear
