Imports: Rcpp, parallel, tibble, recipes, rlang, generics, stats, utils
LinkingTo: Rcpp
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), roxygen2
Config/testthat/edition: 3
SystemRequirements: Linux x86_64, Intel oneAPI DPC++/C++ compiler (icpx),
    Intel oneMKL LP64 (multithread), Intel OpenMP (libiomp5), GNU make,
    a compiler supporting the ISO C++ 2020 standard
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
